            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mɛmɛ ɛ jɛn warɛgak ciöötni gan A-dam. Mëë cak Kuoth naath, cuɛ kɛ cak nikɛ cätdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ kɛ cak tuut kɛnɛ ŋuɔ̱ɔ̱t. Kä cuɛ kɛ poth kä cuɛ kɛ cɔl i̱ Naath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ gua̱a̱th ëë ci A-dam tekɛ run ti kuɔ̱r kɛl wi̱cdɛ jiɛn diɔ̱k, cuɛ gat di̱eth kä cuɛ jɛ cal kɛ cätdɛ pa̱ny, kä cuɛ ciötdɛ cɔl i̱ Thɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr däpä Thɛth cu run teekä A-dam a run ti kur bädäk ɛgi̱m. Kä cuɛ dhɔɔl kɛnɛ nyi̱er kɔ̱kiɛn lɛni di̱eth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛ nɔ, täämɛ mat runi teekä A-dam diaal kɛ run ti kur bäŋuan wi̱cdɛ jiɛn diɔ̱k, cuɛ cu li̱w.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
