              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Thɛth tekɛ run ti kuɔ̱r kɛl wi̱cdɛ dhieec, cuɛ I-nɔc di̱eth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr däpä I-nɔc cu run teekä Thɛth a run ti kur bädäk wi̱cdɛ bärɔw, kä cuɛ dhɔɔl kɛnɛ nyi̱er kɔ̱kiɛn lɛni di̱eth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛ nɔ, täämɛ mat runi teekä Thɛth diaal kɛ run ti kur bäŋuan wi̱cdɛ jiath kɛl wi̱cdɛ rɛw, cuɛ cu li̱w.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.8"
