              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ ciötdɛ cɔl i̱ Nowa, laarɛ jɛ i̱, “Bi gat ɛmɛ kɔn lor lätnikɔn kɛnɛ cuɔ̱cdan muun in ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ bit.” ",
          "type": "text",
